---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const updated = "11 July 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="PolyProject — Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for PolyProject, the native Mac production tracker by DataIsland Software LLC, included with the PolySpeak bundle."
>

  <section class="legal fade-in">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/privacy">← All Privacy Policies</a></div>

    <h1>PolyProject — Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="meta">DataIsland Software LLC &nbsp;·&nbsp; Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <p>
      PolyProject is a native Mac production tracker, included with the PolySpeak
      voice-production bundle and not sold individually. Its role in the suite is small,
      but its privacy behavior is worth documenting on its own like every other app in
      PolySpeak.
    </p>

    <h2>Summary</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>PolyProject makes no network requests and has no AI features at all.</strong>
      It reads and writes a single local manifest file and displays status information
      gathered from files produced by the other PolySpeak apps. The app has no server,
      no account, and no analytics.
    </p>

    <h2>What PolyProject Accesses</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>A <code>.polyproject</code> manifest file (JSON) that it reads and writes</li>
      <li>
        Output files produced nearby by the other PolySpeak apps — script files from
        PolyScript, read-through audio from TableRead, and performance capture exports
        from Studio — read only to display status. PolyProject does not modify these files
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      PolyProject does not access your microphone, camera, contacts, location, photos, or
      calendar.
    </p>

    <h2>What Leaves Your Device</h2>

    <h3>Nothing</h3>
    <p>
      PolyProject has no network features and no AI features at all. Everything it reads
      and writes stays on your Mac.
    </p>

    <h2>What Is Stored Locally</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>The <code>.polyproject</code> manifest file</strong> — saved wherever you choose on your Mac</li>
    </ul>
    <p>None of this data is synced to iCloud or transmitted to DataIsland.</p>

    <h2>What PolyProject Does Not Do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Does not transmit any data anywhere</li>
      <li>Does not require an account or login</li>
      <li>Does not collect analytics, usage statistics, or crash reports</li>
      <li>Does not modify the files produced by other PolySpeak apps — it only reads them for status display</li>
      <li>Does not share data with third parties</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      PolyProject is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect
      information from children.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      If we make material changes to this policy, we will update the "Last updated" date above.
      Continued use of PolyProject after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy:<br />
      <a href="mailto:support@dataisland.com">support@dataisland.com</a><br />
      DataIsland Software LLC
    </p>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .breadcrumb { margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }

  .legal h1 { font-size: 2.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .meta { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 2rem; }

  .legal h2 { margin-top: 2.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .legal h3 { margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .legal p  { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }

  ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 1.25rem;
    color: var(--gray-dark);
  }

  ul li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.97rem; line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
